# A practice Dance Competition (decomp scripts_contest_hall_lobby.s, FieldTask_RunPracticeCompetition, overlay017
# DanceCompetition_*; docs/research/contests.md §6): the practice receptionist, PRACTICE, DANCE (no contest type to
# pick), Staravia; the MC's practice lines, the song, three rounds of rivals leading and Staravia leading the last; no
# word on the leader after a practice. Staravia copies no one and dances its three steps a measure on the beats, so its
# points are the lead's 2 × 3 × 2 on every seed; the verdict follows, and NO to another try.
party 0 platinum:SPECIES_STARAVIA 20 platinum:MOVE_WING_ATTACK platinum:MOVE_QUICK_ATTACK
set flag platinum:FLAG_CONTEST_HALL_VISITED true
set var platinum:VAR_CONTEST_HALL_LOBBY_STATE 1
warp platinum:MAP_HEADER_CONTEST_HALL_LOBBY 27 6 up
until idle
+0 press a
+1 release a
advance text
until menu
+2 press a
+1 release a
+8 release a
until menu
+2 press down
+1 release down
+2 press a
+1 release a
advance text
until app party 600
+2 tap slot:0
+2 tap menu:0
until app none 600
advance text 6000
until app contest 6000
+0 assert state contest.mode "practice"
+0 assert state contest.competition 5
until state app.round.message.waiting true 60
+2 screenshot dance-intro
# The MC's pages: A on each, eight presses for however many pages the build's language has (a spare press lands
# before the step buttons are up, so it takes no step). Then the song (120 BPM: a beat is 15 ticks, a measure 240),
# timed from the step buttons first coming up, 254 ticks after the MC's last page
+2 press a
+1 release a
+4 press a
+1 release a
+4 press a
+1 release a
+4 press a
+1 release a
+4 press a
+1 release a
+4 press a
+1 release a
+4 press a
+1 release a
+4 press a
+1 release a
until state app.round.buttons.dim false 600
+146 screenshot dance-backup
+1564 press down
+1 release down
+29 press left
+1 release left
+29 press right
+1 release right
+60 screenshot dance-lead
+119 press down
+1 release down
+29 press left
+1 release left
+29 press right
+1 release right
until app none 2000
+0 assert state contest.scores.dance[0] 12
advance text 6000
until yesno 6000
+2 press b
+1 release b
advance text 6000
until idle 6000
+0 assert state party[0].ribbons []
